---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Cultural Dos and Don'ts in China — A Practical Guide";
const description = "Chinese cultual etiquette guide for foreigners: chopstick rules, gift giving, saving face, photography rules, and what not to do in China.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Tips
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
  <header class="mb-12">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛡️ 中国旅游小贴士</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
      Cultural Dos and Don'ts in China<br class="hidden md:block" />— A Practical Guide
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">了解一些关键的事情，你的旅行会更加顺利。</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
      <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-purple-800 leading-relaxed">
      Chinese people are <strong>非常理解</strong> of foreign visitors who don't know local customs. Nobody expects you to be perfect. But knowing a few key things will make your trip smoother and help you connect with locals better.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Table of Contents -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 在本指南中</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3">
      <li><a href="#the-basics" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">✅ 基础知识</a></li>
      <li><a href="#impress-locals" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⭐ 会给当地人留下深刻印象的事情</a></li>
      <li><a href="#things-that-matter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⚠️ 真正重要的事情</a></li>
      <li><a href="#smoking" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚬 吸烟怎么办？</a></li>
      <li><a href="#golden-rule" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💎 黄金法则</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
      Chinese people are incredibly understanding of foreign visitors who don't know local customs. Nobody expects you to be perfect. But knowing a few key things will make your trip smoother and help you connect with locals better.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">
      I've organized this into three levels: things most people already know, things that will genuinely impress locals, and things that really matter.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <h2 id="the-basics" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> The Basics
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-3">🥢 筷子规则</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li>不要把它们竖直地放在你的饭碗里（类似于葬礼香）</li>
          <li>别用它们敲你的碗（乞丐就是这么做的）</li>
          <li>把它们放在筷子架上或放在盘子里</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🍵 为他人倒饮料</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
          In China, you pour drinks for the people around you, and they pour for you. Pouring your own drink is seen as a bit self-centered.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">🎁 赠礼</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li>不要给时钟（听起来像中文的“参加葬礼”）</li>
          <li>用红色或金色包装礼物，而不是白色或黑色（葬礼颜色）</li>
          <li>不要在送礼者面前打开礼物——稍后打开是有礼貌的</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🚫 请勿指向或触碰头部</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li>用手指指着别人被认为是不礼貌的。用张开的手或下巴做手势。</li>
          <li>在中国文化中，头部被视为个人/神圣的。甚至拍孩子的头也会感觉不舒服。</li>
          <li>数字4在中文里听起来像“死亡”。建筑物经常跳过四楼。避免以4件一套的方式赠送礼物。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <h2 id="impress-locals" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">⭐</span> Things That Will Impress Locals
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">这些小动作表明你已经付出了努力。中国人会真正欣赏他们：</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">🍽️ 餐桌礼仪</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>等待主人开始用餐</strong> before you begin</li>
          <li><strong>尝试一切</strong> that'不要在送礼者面前打开礼物're not sure what it is. It shows respect for the host</li>
          <li><strong>说“我吃饱了”</strong> (我饱了 / wǒ bǎo le) when you're done</li>
          <li><strong>收到礼物或名片时</strong>，用双手</li>
          <li><strong>如果有人请你喝茶</strong>，接受它。拒绝就像拒绝款待</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-3">🍶 白酒仪式</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          If a Chinese host offers you baijiu (Chinese liquor), they're showing you respect. You don't need to drink it all — a small sip is fine. But refusing entirely can feel dismissive.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
          When toasting, hold your glass slightly lower than the person you're toasting with — it's a traditional sign of respect.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-yellow-900 mb-3">�面子 挽回面子</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
          This is the single most important concept in Chinese social interaction. "Face" means dignity, reputation, and social standing. <strong>永远不要在别人面前公开批评、尴尬或直接对抗某人。</strong> If you have a complaint or disagreement, discuss it privately.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <h2 id="things-that-matter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">⚠️</span> Things That Actually Matter
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-400 p-6 rounded-r-xl not-prose">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">📸 摄影规则——这很重要</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>不要拍摄军事场所、警察检查站或政府大楼</strong> — this can get you detained</li>
          <li>在拍摄人物之前征求许可，特别是在农村或少数民族地区</li>
          <li>无人机飞行在大多数城市都受到限制，需要注册</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-400 p-6 rounded-r-xl not-prose">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-3">📄 正确获取官方文件</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li>如果你从中国香港, 中国澳门, or 中国台湾,使用特殊的跨境通道</li>
          <li><strong>始终携带护照或清晰的护照照片</strong> — police do random checks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border-l-4 border-purple-400 p-6 rounded-r-xl not-prose">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">⚖️ 尊重当地法律</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li>中国对言论、网络内容和政治讨论有严格的法律</li>
          <li>As a visitor, the safest approach is to <strong>避免政治话题</strong> — you're here as a tourist, not a commentator</li>
          <li>网络审查是真实的。在不了解风险的情况下，不要尝试使用酒店WiFi或公共网络访问被屏蔽的网站</li>
          <li>这些规则适用于所有人，包括中国公民</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <h2 id="smoking" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🚬</span> What About Smoking?
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-gray-100 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
        <li>🚭 室内公共场所禁止吸烟</li>
        <li>🚬 你会看到很多户外吸烟——这是日常生活的一部分</li>
        <li>📍 如果你吸烟，请寻找指定的吸烟区</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <h2 id="golden-rule" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">💎</span> The Golden Rule
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-purple-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-900 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Here's the thing: <strong>中国人不指望你完美。</strong> What matters most is your attitude.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        <strong>微笑。 Say 谢谢 （xi谢。 Say 对不起 当你犯错时。</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        These three things will get you through 95% of awkward situations. I've seen foreigners make every etiquette mistake in this guide, and still have a wonderful time in China, just because they were friendly and respectful.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mt-4 font-semibold">
        China is a country of 1.4 billion people. We're used to diversity. We're genuinely happy to see visitors who are curious about our culture. If you come with an open mind, people will meet you with warmth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
  </div>

  <!-- Related Guides -->
  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/zh/tips/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">去中国旅行安全吗？</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">当地人的诚实回答</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/tips/common-scams/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国常见的骗局以及如何避免</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">不要让骗子毁了你的旅行</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/tips/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">紧急电话号码和该怎么办</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在需要之前先保存这些</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</Layout>